1
00:00:31,640 --> 00:00:34,633
<font color="#ccffff">Dos familias de idéntico linaje,</font>
<font color="#ffff33">Two households, both alike in dignity,</font>

2
00:00:34,653 --> 00:00:37,793
<font color="#ccffff">en la bella Verona, lugar de la acción,</font>
<font color="#ffff33">in fair Verona, where we lay our scene,</font>

3
00:00:37,813 --> 00:00:40,853
<font color="#ccffff">inician nuevas peleas por viejos odios.</font>
<font color="#ffff33">from ancient grudge break to new mutiny,</font>

4
00:00:40,973 --> 00:00:44,153
<font color="#ccffff">La sangre de la ciudad mancha de sangre al ciudadano.</font>
<font color="#ffff33">where civil blood makes civil hands unclean.</font>

5
00:00:44,173 --> 00:00:46,993
<font color="#ccffff">De las oscuras entrañas de los dos rivales,</font>
<font color="#ffff33">From forth the fatal loins of these two foes,</font>

6
00:00:47,013 --> 00:00:50,073
<font color="#ccffff">nacieron dos amantes con mal sino.</font>
<font color="#ffff33">a pair of star-cross'd lovers take their life;</font>

7
00:00:50,093 --> 00:00:52,713
<font color="#ccffff">Su lamentable fin, su desventura,</font>
<font color="#ffff33">whose misadventured piteous overthrows</font>

8
00:00:52,733 --> 00:00:55,993
<font color="#ccffff">entierra con su muerte el rencor de los padres.</font>
<font color="#ffff33">doth with their death bury their parents' strife.</font>

9
00:00:56,013 --> 00:00:58,833
<font color="#ccffff">El terrible desarrollo de su amor mortal</font>
<font color="#ffff33">The fearful passage of their death-mark'd love</font>

10
00:00:58,853 --> 00:01:01,593
<font color="#ccffff">y la inconmensurable ira paterna,</font>
<font color="#ffff33">and the continuance of their parents rage,</font>

11
00:01:01,613 --> 00:01:05,433
<font color="#ccffff">que sólo el fin de los dos hijos conseguirá extinguir,</font>
<font color="#ffff33">which, but their children's end, nought could remove,</font>

12
00:01:05,453 --> 00:01:09,959
<font color="#ccffff">ocupará nuesta atención en las próximas horas.</font>
<font color="#ffff33">is now the two hours' traffic of our stage.</font>

13
00:01:10,493 --> 00:01:16,442
<font color="#ccffff">EN LA BELLA VERONA</font>
<font color="#ffff33"></font>

14
