00:33:05,813 --> 00:33:08,953
<font color="#ccffff">¡Pronto le he visto y tarde le conozco!</font>
<font color="#ffff33">Too early seen unknown, and known too late!</font>

377
00:33:08,973 --> 00:33:15,709
<font color="#ccffff">Extraño nacimiento del amor, que me hace amar a mi peor enemigo.</font>
<font color="#ffff33">Prodigious birth of love it is to me, that I must love a loathed enemy.</font>

378
00:33:26,253 --> 00:33:28,393
<font color="#ccffff">Me retiraré.</font>
<font color="#ffff33">I will withdraw.</font>

379
00:33:28,413 --> 00:33:31,913
<font color="#ccffff">Pero esta intrusión que ahora parece ser tan agradable,</font>
<font color="#ffff33">But this intrusion shall, now seeming sweet,</font>

380
00:33:31,933 --> 00:33:35,189
<font color="#ccffff">se volverá amarga hiel.</font>
<font color="#ffff33">convert to bitterest gall.</font>

381
00:33:37,773 --> 00:33:41,154
<font color="#ccffff">¡Soy un buen pedazo de carne!</font>
<font color="#ffff33">A pretty piece of flesh! I am!</font>

382
00:33:42,133 --> 00:33:44,713
<font color="#ccffff">Soy un buen pedazo de carne...</font>
<font color="#ffff33">A pretty piece of...</font>

383
00:33:44,733 --> 00:33:45,793
<font color="#ccffff">¡Romeo!</font>
<font color="#ffff33">Romeo!</font>

384
00:33:45,813 --> 00:33:47,673
<font color="#ccffff">- ¡Romeo! - ¡Romeo!</font>
<font color="#ffff33">- Romeo! - Romeo!</font>

385
00:33:47,693 --> 00:33:48,753
<font color="#ccffff">¡Romeo!</font>
<font color="#ffff33">Romeo!</font>

386
00:33:48,773 --> 00:33:51,393
<font color="#ccffff">¡Caprichos! ¡Loco!</font>
<font color="#ffff33">Humors! Madman!</font>

387
00:33:51,413 --> 00:33:54,513
<font color="#ccffff">¡Pasiones! ¡Enamorado!</font>
<font color="#ffff33">Passion! Lover!</font>

388
00:33:54,533 --> 00:33:57,393
<font color="#ccffff">¡Yo te conjuro por los ojos claros de Rosalina,</font>
<font color="#ffff33">I will conjure thee by Rosaline's bright eyes,</font>

389
00:33:57,413 --> 00:34:00,433
<font color="#ccffff">por su alta frente, por sus labios escarlata,</font>
<font color="#ffff33">by her high forehead and her scarlet lip,</font>

390
00:34:00,453 --> 00:34:06,359
<font color="#ccffff">por sus finos pies, rectas piernas y trémulos muslos!</font>
<font color="#ffff33">by her fine foot, straight leg, and quivering thigh!</font>

391
00:34:08,133 --> 00:34:12,473
<font color="#ccffff">¡Ay, Romeo, si ella fuese un higo abierto y tú una pera!</font>
<font color="#ffff33">O Romeo, that she were an open-ass and thou a poperin pear!</font>

392
00:34:12,493 --> 00:34:14,993
<font color="#ccffff">Ríese de la cicatriz quien nunca tuvo herida.</font>
<font color="#ffff33">He jests at scars that never felt the wound.</font>

393
00:34:15,013 --> 00:34:16,551
<font color="#ccffff">¡Romeo!</font>
<font color="#ffff33">Romeo!</font>

394
00:34:16,893 --> 00:34:18,033
<font color="#ccffff">¡Buenas noches!</font>
<font color="#ffff33">Good night!</font>

395
00:34:18,053 --> 00:34:24,391
<font color="#ccffff">Me voy a mi camastro. Esta cama de campaña está fría para dormir.</font>
<font color="#ffff33">I'll to my truckle-bed. This field-bed is too cold for me to sleep.</font>

396
00:34:59,773 --> 00:35:01,513
<font color="#ccffff">¡Pero calla!</font>
<font color="#ffff33">But soft!</font>

397
00:35:01,533 --> 00:35:04,630
<font color="#ccffff">¿Qué luz se abre paso por esa ventana?</font>
<font color="#ffff33">What light through yonder window breaks?</font>

398
00:35:09,573 --> 00:35:11,633
<font color="#ccffff">¡Es el Oriente,</font>
<font color="#ffff33">It is the east,</font>

399
00:35:11,653 --> 00:35:15,273
<font color="#ccffff">y Julieta es el sol!</font>
<font color="#ffff33">and Juliet is the sun!</font>

400
00:35:18,213 --> 00:35:21,913
<font color="#ccffff">Sal, bello sol, y mata a la envidiosa luna,</font>
<font color="#ffff33">Arise, fair sun, and kill the envious moon,</font>

401
00:35:21,933 --> 00:35:24,593
<font color="#ccffff">que ya está enferma y palidece de dolor,</font>
<font color="#ffff33">who is already sick and pale with grief</font>

402
00:35:24,613 --> 00:35:28,473
<font color="#ccffff">pues que tú, su doncella, eres más hermosa que ella.</font>
<font color="#ffff33">that thou, her maid, art far more fair than she.</font>

403
00:35:28,493 --> 00:35:31,633
<font color="#ccffff">No seas su doncella si es tan envidiosa.</font>
<font color="#ffff33">Be not her maid, since she is envious.</font>

404
00:35:31,653 --> 00:35:37,718
<font color="#ccffff">Su manto de vestal es de un verde pálido y propio de bufones.</font>
<font color="#ffff33">Her vestal livery is but sick and green, and none but fools do wear it.</font>

405
00:35:38,093 --> 00:35:41,838
<font color="#ccffff">¡Oh, aléjalo de ti!</font>
<font color="#ffff33">O cast it off!</font>

406
00:35:49,813 --> 00:35:52,673
<font color="#ccffff">Es mi dama, es mi amor.</font>
<font color="#ffff33">It is my lady, it is my love.</font>

407
00:35:52,693 --> 00:35:55,551
<font color="#ccffff">Si al menos ella lo supiera.</font>
<font color="#ffff33">O that she knew she were.</font>

408
00:36:02,093 --> 00:36:04,154
<font color="#ccffff">¡Ay de mí!</font>
<font color="#ffff33">Ay me!</font>

409
00:36:06,373 --> 00:36:08,433
<font color="#ccffff">Habla.</font>
<font color="#ffff33">She speaks.</font>

410
00:36:08,453 --> 00:36:11,311
<font color="#ccffff">Habla de nuevo, ángel radiante.</font>
<font color="#ffff33">Speak again, bright angel.</font>

411
00:36:12,253 --> 00:36:14,519
<font color="#ccffff">Romeo.</font>
<font color="#ffff33">Romeo.</font>

412
00:36:14,933 --> 00:36:16,633
<font color="#ccffff">¡Oh, Romeo!</font>
<font color="#ffff33">O Romeo!</font>

413
00:36:16,653 --> 00:36:19,511
<font color="#ccffff">Si otro fuese tu nombre.</font>
<font color="#ffff33">Wherefore art thou Romeo?</font>

414
00:36:23,133 --> 00:36:25,393
<font color="#ccffff">Reniega de tu padre y rechaza tu nombre.</font>
<font color="#ffff33">Deny thy father and refuse thy name.</font>

415
00:36:25,413 --> 00:36:31,673
<font color="#ccffff">O jura al menos tu amor y dejaré de ser yo Capuleto.</font>
<font color="#ffff33">Or, if thou wilt not, be but sworn my love, and I'll no longer be a Capulet.</font>

416
00:36:31,693 --> 00:36:33,753
<font color="#ccffff">¿Debo escuchar aún</font>
<font color="#ffff33">Shall I hear more,</font>

417
00:36:33,773 --> 00:36:35,753
<font color="#ccffff">o hablarte ahora?</font>
<font color="#ffff33">or shall I speak at this?</font>

418
00:36:35,773 --> 00:36:38,593
<font color="#ccffff">Sólo tu nombre es mi enemigo.</font>
<font color="#ffff33">'Tis but thy name that is my enemy.</font>

419
00:36:38,613 --> 00:36:41,393
<font color="#ccffff">Tú eres tú mismo, Montesco o no.</font>
<font color="#ffff33">Thou art thyself, though not a Montague.</font>

420
00:36:41,413 --> 00:36:43,433
<font color="#ccffff">¿ Y qué es Montesco?</font>
<font color="#ffff33">What's Montague?</font>

421
00:36:43,453 --> 00:36:45,313
<font color="#ccffff">No es mano,</font>
<font color="#ffff33">It is not hand,</font>

422
00:36:45,333 --> 00:36:48,589
<font color="#ccffff">ni pie, ni brazo, ni cara,</font>
<font color="#ffff33">nor foot, nor arm, nor face,</font>

423
00:36:49,853 --> 00:36:53,393
<font color="#ccffff">ni ninguna otra parte de un hombre.</font>
<font color="#ffff33">nor any other part belonging to a man.</font>

424
00:36:53,413 --> 00:36:56,271
<font color="#ccffff">¡Oh, llámate de otro modo!</font>
<font color="#ffff33">O be some other name!</font>

425
00:36:57,693 --> 00:37:00,233
<font color="#ccffff">¿Qué hay en un nombre?</font>
<font color="#ffff33">What's in a name?</font>

426
00:37:00,253 --> 00:37:04,353
<font color="#ccffff">Lo que llamamos rosa aun con cualquier otro nombre mantendría el perfume.</font>
<font color="#ffff33">That which we call a rose by any other word would smell as sweet.</font>

427
00:37:04,373 --> 00:37:07,553
<font color="#ccffff">Igual que Romeo. Aunque Romeo nunca se llamase,</font>
<font color="#ffff33">So Romeo would, were he not Romeo called,</font>

428
00:37:07,573 --> 00:37:13,233
<font color="#ccffff">conservaría la misma perfección que tiene sin ese título.</font>
<font color="#ffff33">retain that dear perfection which he owes without that title.</font>

429
00:37:13,253 --> 00:37:15,193
<font color="#ccffff">Romeo, quítate el nombre;</font>
<font color="#ffff33">Romeo, doff thy name;</font>

430
00:37:15,213 --> 00:37:18,673
<font color="#ccffff">y a cambio del nombre, que no es parte de ti, tómame entera.</font>
<font color="#ffff33">and for thy name, which is no part of thee, take all myself.</font>

431
00:37:18,693 --> 00:37:21,551
<font color="#ccffff">Te tomo la palabra.</font>
<font color="#ffff33">I take thee at thy word.</font>

432
00:37:30,933 --> 00:37:32,993
<font color="#ccffff">¿No eres Romeo y además Montesco?</font>
<font color="#ffff33">Art thou not Romeo, and a Montague?</font>

433
00:37:33,013 --> 00:37:35,353
<font color="#ccffff">Ni una cosa ni otra si te disgustan.</font>
<font color="#ffff33">Neither, fair maid, if either thee dislike.</font>

434
00:37:35,373 --> 00:37:37,793
<font color="#ccffff">¿Cómo llegaste aquí y por qué razón?</font>
<font color="#ffff33">How camest thou hither, tell me, and wherefore?</font>

435
00:37:37,813 --> 00:37:39,833
<font color="#ccffff">La tapia del jardín es alta y dif'icil de trepar,</font>
<font color="#ffff33">The garden walls are high and hard to climb,</font>

436
00:37:39,853 --> 00:37:42,273
<font color="#ccffff">y este lugar es mortal siendo quien eres.</font>
<font color="#ffff33">and the place death, considering who thou art.</font>

437
00:37:42,293 --> 00:37:44,953
<font color="#ccffff">Con las alas del amor he saltados estos muros,</font>
<font color="#ffff33">With love's light wings did I o'erperch these walls,</font>

438
00:37:44,973 --> 00:37:47,033
<font color="#ccffff">pues que para el amor no existen límites.</font>
<font color="#ffff33">for stony limits cannot hold love out,</font>

439
00:37:47,053 --> 00:37:49,473
<font color="#ccffff">Y como el amor hace lo que puede,</font>
<font color="#ffff33">and what love can do, that dares love attempt.</font>

440
00:37:49,493 --> 00:37:52,999
<font color="#ccffff">¡tus parientes no han de intimidarme!</font>
<font color="#ffff33">Therefore thy kinsmen are no stop to me!</font>

441
00:38:13,813 --> 00:38:17,478
<font color="#ccffff">Si te encuentran aquí te matarán.</font>
<font color="#ffff33">If they do see thee, they will murder thee.</font>

442
00:38:20,573 --> 00:38:24,113
<font color="#ccffff">El manto de la noche me esconderá de ellos.</font>
<font color="#ffff33">I have night's cloak to hide me from their eyes.</font>

443
00:38:24,133 --> 00:38:26,193
<font color="#ccffff">Si no llegas a amarme,</font>
<font color="#ffff33">But thou love me,</font>

444
00:38:26,213 --> 00:38:28,673
<font color="#ccffff">que me encuentren aquí.</font>
<font color="#ffff33">let them find me here.</font>

445
00:38:28,693 --> 00:38:35,156
<font color="#ccffff">Más vale que acabe mi vida por su odio que prorrogar la muerte</font>
<font color="#ffff33">My life were better ended by their hate than death prorogued,</font>

446
00:38:36,293 --> 00:38:39,151
<font color="#ccffff">sin tu amor.</font>
<font color="#ffff33">wanting of thy love.</font>

447
00:39:16,053 --> 00:39:18,593
<font color="#ccffff">La máscara de la noche oculta mi rostro;</font>
<font color="#ffff33">Thou knowest the mask of night is on my face;</font>

448
00:39:18,613 --> 00:39:20,993
<font color="#ccffff">o un rubor virginal cubriría mis mejillas</font>
<font color="#ffff33">else would a maiden blush bepaint my cheek</font>

449
00:39:21,013 --> 00:39:23,633
<font color="#ccffff">por cuanto me has oído decir esta noche.</font>
<font color="#ffff33">for that which thou hast heard me speak tonight.</font>

450
00:39:23,653 --> 00:39:25,713
<font color="#ccffff">Si pudiera guardar la compostura,</font>
<font color="#ffff33">Fain would I dwell on form,</font>

451
00:39:25,733 --> 00:39:27,833
<font color="#ccffff">si pudiera negar todo lo que he dicho.</font>
<font color="#ffff33">fain, fain deny what I have spoke.</font>

452
00:39:27,853 --> 00:39:31,109
<font color="#ccffff">Pero... Fuera tú, fingimiento.</font>
<font color="#ffff33">But... farewell compliment.</font>

453
00:39:31,893 --> 00:39:34,751
<font color="#ccffff">¿Me amáis?</font>
<font color="#ffff33">Dost thou love me?</font>

454
00:39:35,493 --> 00:39:38,033
<font color="#ccffff">Ya sé que diréis que sí, y yo os creeré.</font>
<font color="#ffff33">I know thou wilt say "Ay", and I will take thy word.</font>

455
00:39:38,053 --> 00:39:40,553
<font color="#ccffff">Y juraréis y podríais jurar en falso.</font>
<font color="#ffff33">Yet, if thou swear'st, thou may'st prove false.</font>

456
00:39:40,573 --> 00:39:43,993
<font color="#ccffff">Oh dulce Romeo, di que me amas, dímelo en verdad.</font>
<font color="#ffff33">O gentle Romeo, if thou dost love, pronounce it faithfully.</font>

457
00:39:44,013 --> 00:39:46,473
<font color="#ccffff">Señora, lo juro por la sagrada luna</font>
<font color="#ffff33">Lady, by yonder blessed moon I vow,</font>

458
00:39:46,493 --> 00:39:49,753
<font color="#ccffff">que tiñe de plata las copas de esos frutales...</font>
<font color="#ffff33">that tips with silver all these fruit tree tops...</font>

459
00:39:49,773 --> 00:39:51,833
<font color="#ccffff">No jures por la luna,</font>
<font color="#ffff33">O swear not by the moon,</font>

460
00:39:51,853 --> 00:39:55,633
<font color="#ccffff">la luna inconstante que cambia cada mes en su órbita redonda.</font>
<font color="#ffff33">the inconstant moon that monthly changes in her circled orb,</font>

461
00:39:55,653 --> 00:39:58,433
<font color="#ccffff">No sea que tu amor resulte tan variable.</font>
<font color="#ffff33">lest that thy love prove likewise variable.</font>

462
00:39:58,453 --> 00:40:01,153
<font color="#ccffff">¿ Y por quién he de jurar?</font>
<font color="#ffff33">What shall I swear by?</font>

463
00:40:01,173 --> 00:40:03,233
<font color="#ccffff">No has de jurar por nadie.</font>
<font color="#ffff33">Do not swear at all.</font>

464
00:40:03,253 --> 00:40:05,313
<font color="#ccffff">O, si lo haces,</font>
<font color="#ffff33">Or, if thou wilt,</font>

465
00:40:05,333 --> 00:40:09,193
<font color="#ccffff">jura por ti mismo, que eres el dios que adoro.</font>
<font color="#ffff33">swear by thy gracious self which is the god of my idolatry,</font>

466
00:40:09,213 --> 00:40:11,633
<font color="#ccffff">Sólo entonces te creeré.</font>
<font color="#ffff33">and I'll believe thee.</font>

467
00:40:11,653 --> 00:40:14,153
<font color="#ccffff">Si el amor...</font>
<font color="#ffff33">If my heart's...</font>

468
00:40:14,173 --> 00:40:17,031
<font color="#ccffff">sagrado de mi corazón...</font>
<font color="#ffff33">dear love...</font>

469
00:40:25,453 --> 00:40:30,873
<font color="#ccffff">No, no jures. Aunque seas mi alegría no me alegra este pacto nocturno,</font>
<font color="#ffff33">Do not swear. Although I joy in thee, I have no joy in this contract tonight.</font>

470
00:40:30,893 --> 00:40:34,273
<font color="#ccffff">tan repentino, insensato y temerario como un relámpago que se apaga</font>
<font color="#ffff33">It is too rash, too unadvised, too sudden, too like the lightning,</font>

471
00:40:34,293 --> 00:40:36,913
<font color="#ccffff">antes de poder nombrarlo.</font>
<font color="#ffff33">which doth cease to be ere one can say "It lightens".</font>

472
00:40:36,933 --> 00:40:38,393
<font color="#ccffff">¡Buenas noches!</font>
<font color="#ffff33">Sweet, good night!</font>

473
00:40:38,413 --> 00:40:41,073
<font color="#ccffff">Este amor tierno, madurado por el aliento del estío,</font>
<font color="#ffff33">This bud of love, by summer's ripening breath,</font>

474
00:40:41,093 --> 00:40:43,793
<font color="#ccffff">puede dar una bonita flor cuando volvamos a encontrarnos.</font>
<font color="#ffff33">may prove a beauteous flower when next we meet.</font>

475
00:40:43,813 --> 00:40:45,715
<font color="#ccffff">Buenas noches.</font>
<font color="#ffff33">Good night.</font>

476
00:40:46,293 --> 00:40:48,639
<font color="#ccffff">¡Buenas noches!</font>
<font color="#ffff33">Good night!</font>

477
00:40:50,093 --> 00:40:52,916
<font color="#ccffff">¿Así de insatisfecho me dejáis?</font>
<font color="#ffff33">O wilt thou leave me so unsatisfied?</font>

478
00:40:54,093 --> 00:40:57,349
<font color="#ccffff">¿Cabe esta noche otra satisfacción?</font>
<font color="#ffff33">What satisfaction canst thou have tonight?</font>

479
00:40:58,493 --> 00:41:03,830
<font color="#ccffff">Dame tu amor, que yo te daré el mío.</font>
<font color="#ffff33">The exchange of thy love's faithful vow for mine.</font>

480
00:41:05,413 --> 00:41:09,158
<font color="#ccffff">¡Te he dado el mío sin que lo pidieras!</font>
<font color="#ffff33">I gave thee mine before thou didst request it!</font>

481
00:41:18,093 --> 00:41:20,439
<font color="#ccffff">¡Julieta!</font>
<font color="#ffff33">Juliet!</font>

482
00:41:27,213 --> 00:41:29,593
<font color="#ccffff">Tres palabras aún, Romeo, y me despido.</font>
<font color="#ffff33">Three words, dear Romeo, and good night indeed.</font>

483
00:41:29,613 --> 00:41:32,633
<font color="#ccffff">Si he de creer en tus votos de amor, si me deseas como esposa,</font>
<font color="#ffff33">If that thy bent of love be honorable, thy purpose marriage,</font>

484
00:41:32,653 --> 00:41:35,513
<font color="#ccffff">envíame recado mañana, por alguien que enviaré,</font>
<font color="#ffff33">send me word tomorrow, by one that I'll procure to come to thee,</font>

485
00:41:35,533 --> 00:41:37,793
<font color="#ccffff">del lugar y día de la ceremonia,</font>
<font color="#ffff33">where and what time thou wilt perform the rite,</font>

486
00:41:37,813 --> 00:41:39,753
<font color="#ccffff">Pondré mi destino a tus pies,</font>
<font color="#ffff33">and all my fortunes at thy foot I'll lay</font>

487
00:41:39,773 --> 00:41:41,993
<font color="#ccffff">y te seguiré como mi señor por el mundo.</font>
<font color="#ffff33">and follow thee, my lord, throughout the world.</font>

488
00:41:42,013 --> 00:41:43,713
<font color="#ccffff">¡Julieta!</font>
<font color="#ffff33">Julieta!</font>

489
00:41:43,733 --> 00:41:45,833
<font color="#ccffff">¡Que sí! ¡Ama, ya voy!</font>
<font color="#ffff33">Ay! By and by, I come!</font>

490
00:41:45,853 --> 00:41:48,793
<font color="#ccffff">Pero si tu amor no fuera honesto, te suplico...</font>
<font color="#ffff33">But if thou meanest not well, I do beseech thee...</font>

491
00:41:48,813 --> 00:41:50,873
<font color="#ccffff">- ¡Julieta! - ¡Que sí! ¡Ya voy!</font>
<font color="#ffff33">- Juliet! - By and by, I come!</font>

492
00:41:50,893 --> 00:41:54,993
<font color="#ccffff">...que abandones tu empeño y me dejes con mi pena.</font>
<font color="#ffff33">...to cease thy strife, and leave me to my grief.</font>

493
00:41:55,013 --> 00:41:56,793
<font color="#ccffff">Mañana te enviaré a alguien.</font>
<font color="#ffff33">Tomorrow will I send.</font>

494
00:41:56,813 --> 00:41:59,511
<font color="#ccffff">Hacedlo, por mi alma.</font>
<font color="#ffff33">So thrive my soul.</font>

495
00:42:06,053 --> 00:42:07,993
<font color="#ccffff">Mil buenas noches tengas.</font>
<font color="#ffff33">A thousand times good night.</font>

496
00:42:08,013 --> 00:42:12,233
<font color="#ccffff">¡Malditas sean las mil si me falta tu luz!</font>
<font color="#ffff33">A thousand times the worse, to want thy light!</font>

497
00:42:12,253 --> 00:42:14,269
<font color="#ccffff">¡Julieta!</font>
<font color="#ffff33">Juliet!</font>

498
00:42:15,293 --> 00:42:17,752
<font color="#ccffff">¡Julieta!</font>
<font color="#ffff33">Julieta!</font>

499
00:42:21,013 --> 00:42:23,598
<font color="#ccffff">Buenas noches.</font>
<font color="#ffff33">Good night.</font>

500
00:42:25,053 --> 00:42:30,193
<font color="#ccffff">El amor atiende al amor como el colegial huye del libro;</font>
<font color="#ffff33">Love goes toward love as schoolboys from their books;</font>

501
00:42:30,213 --> 00:42:33,071
<font color="#ccffff">y como el que va a clase</font>
<font color="#ffff33">but love from love,</font>

502
00:42:33,493 --> 00:42:36,590
