<font color="#ccffff">Despierta</font>
<font color="#ffff33">Wake</font>

1230
01:49:04,918 --> 01:49:07,751
<font color="#ccffff">De tus sueños</font>
<font color="#ffff33">From your sleep</font>

1231
01:49:09,518 --> 01:49:13,138
<font color="#ccffff">Yseca</font>
<font color="#ffff33">The drying of</font>

1232
01:49:13,158 --> 01:49:16,599
<font color="#ccffff">Tus lágrimas</font>
<font color="#ffff33">Your tears</font>

1233
01:49:17,198 --> 01:49:19,797
<font color="#ccffff">Hoy</font>
<font color="#ffff33">Today</font>

1234
01:49:20,358 --> 01:49:22,957
<font color="#ccffff">Hoy escapamos</font>
<font color="#ffff33">We escape</font>

1235
01:49:23,918 --> 01:49:29,396
<font color="#ccffff">Nos escapamos</font>
<font color="#ffff33">We escape</font>

1236
01:49:32,438 --> 01:49:35,231
<font color="#ccffff">Recoge tus cosas</font>
<font color="#ffff33">Pack</font>

1237
01:49:35,358 --> 01:49:38,310
<font color="#ccffff">Yvístete</font>
<font color="#ffff33">And get dressed</font>

1238
01:49:39,918 --> 01:49:43,938
<font color="#ccffff">Antes de que nos oiga</font>
<font color="#ffff33">Before your father</font>

1239
01:49:43,958 --> 01:49:47,149
<font color="#ccffff">Tu padre</font>
<font color="#ffff33">Hears us</font>

1240
01:49:47,158 --> 01:49:49,757
<font color="#ccffff">Antes de que</font>
<font color="#ffff33">Before</font>

1241
01:49:50,478 --> 01:49:53,077
<font color="#ccffff">Todo</font>
<font color="#ffff33">All hell</font>

1242
01:49:54,838 --> 01:49:59,559
<font color="#ccffff">Se alborote</font>
<font color="#ffff33">Breaks loose</font>

1243
01:50:02,318 --> 01:50:07,910
<font color="#ccffff">Respira</font>
<font color="#ffff33">Breathe</font>

1244
01:50:07,998 --> 01:50:10,791
<font color="#ccffff">Respira profundamente</font>
<font color="#ffff33">Keep breathing</font>

1245
01:50:11,718 --> 01:50:16,394
<font color="#ccffff">No pierdas</font>
<font color="#ffff33">Don't lose</font>

1246
01:50:16,678 --> 01:50:19,869
<font color="#ccffff">Los nervios</font>
<font color="#ffff33">Your nerve</font>

1247
01:50:25,038 --> 01:50:30,578
<font color="#ccffff">Respira</font>
<font color="#ffff33">Breathe</font>

1248
01:50:30,598 --> 01:50:33,431
<font color="#ccffff">Continúa respirando</font>
<font color="#ffff33">Keep breathing</font>

1249
01:50:34,558 --> 01:50:38,352
<font color="#ccffff">No puedo hacer esto</font>
<font color="#ffff33">I can't do this</font>

1250
01:50:39,478 --> 01:50:42,999
<font color="#ccffff">Yo solo</font>
<font color="#ffff33">Alone</font>

1251
01:50:51,678 --> 01:50:58,032
<font color="#ccffff">Cántanos</font>
<font color="#ffff33">Sing us a song</font>

1252
01:50:59,078 --> 01:51:07,036
<font color="#ccffff">Una canción para calentarnos</font>
<font color="#ffff33">A song to keep us warm</font>

1253
01:51:07,198 --> 01:51:09,778
<font color="#ccffff">Hace</font>
<font color="#ffff33">There's</font>

1254
01:51:09,798 --> 01:51:12,955
<font color="#ccffff">Tal frío</font>
<font color="#ffff33">Such a chill</font>

1255
01:51:13,758 --> 01:51:19,111
<font color="#ccffff">Tal frío</font>
<font color="#ffff33">Such a chill</font>

1256
01:51:22,518 --> 01:51:28,269
<font color="#ccffff">Puedes reír</font>
<font color="#ffff33">You can laugh</font>

1257
01:51:29,678 --> 01:51:35,958
<font color="#ccffff">Una risa despiadada</font>
<font color="#ffff33">A spineless laugh</font>

1258
01:51:37,278 --> 01:51:39,258
<font color="#ccffff">Esperamos</font>
<font color="#ffff33">We hope</font>

1259
01:51:39,278 --> 01:51:42,978
<font color="#ccffff">Que tus reglas</font>
<font color="#ffff33">Your rules</font>

1260
01:51:42,998 --> 01:51:48,738
<font color="#ccffff">Tu sabiduría</font>
<font color="#ffff33">And wisdom</font>

1261
01:51:48,758 --> 01:51:52,418
<font color="#ccffff">Te atraganten</font>
